SonarQube and the containers exchange absolute file paths, so both must see the storage at the
same path. This bundle mounts `${storage_path}` at that same path inside the containers
(`AGENTIC_STORAGE_MOUNT` in `.env`), so use it on the SonarQube side as well:

```
sonar.agentic.storage.type=FILESYSTEM
sonar.agentic.storage.filesystem.base-dir=${storage_path}
sonar.agentic.orchestrator.storage.type=FILESYSTEM
sonar.agentic.orchestrator.storage.filesystem.base-dir=${storage_path}
```
